        "SQL": "ALTER TABLE \u00A4{KF3_Schema}\u00A4.v3_vejnavn ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS sys_label public.geometry(Point, 25832);\r\n\r\nALTER TABLE \u00A4{KF3_Schema}\u00A4.v3_vejnavn ALTER COLUMN sys_label SET STORAGE MAIN;\r\nUPDATE \u00A4{KF3_Schema}\u00A4.v3_vejnavn AS t -- point\r\nset sys_label = ST_Centroid (ST_Multi (geometri)) \r\nWHERE t.geometri IS NOT null AND t.sys_label IS NULL;"
